{"id":"en_my-system-beats-the-players","title":"My System Beats the Players","titleEn":"My System Beats the Players","description":"A man from the present day opens his eyes to find himself inhabiting the body of a Yellow Turban officer during the Three Kingdoms era. A system grants him access to contemporary military strategy, allowing him to outthink and outmaneuver the warlords around him. He defeats opposing armies and reshapes the course of history. Starting with nothing, he rises until all others submit before him. Those who wish to follow this series can do so on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-system-beats-the-players/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-system-beats-the-players/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Historical","Fantasy","Time Travel","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cjl4y/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_my-system-beats-the-players_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cjl4y/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-system-beats-the-players_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cjl4y/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-system-beats-the-players_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cjl4y/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-system-beats-the-players_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cjl4y/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"